                        tag = "p";
                        attrs = {  };
                        children = list(
                          "Population claims need specified measures, comparisons and time horizons. Simultaneous aggregate trends do not identify individual causal effects. Personal testimony does not supply the other spouse’s account. Prescriptions require normative arguments; an analogy between a business and a marriage requires a bridge."
                        )
                      }
                    )
                  },
                  {
                    tag = "section";
                    attrs = { class = "q-section hh-section" };
                    children = list(
                      { tag = "h2"; attrs = {  }; children = list("Retained sources and executable rules") },
                      {
                        tag = "p";
                        attrs = {  };
                        children = list(
                          "The source listings below preserve the model’s assumptions and derivation for inspection. They belong to one local synthetic evidence family, rather than independent observations of people."
                        )
                      },
                      {
                        tag = "div";
                        attrs = { id = "hh-source-snapshots" };
                        children = list(
                          { tag = "h2"; attrs = {  }; children = list("The executable sources") },
                          $snapshots
                        )
                      }
                    )
                  },
                  {
                    tag = "section";
                    attrs = { class = "q-section hh-section" };
                    children = list(
                      { tag = "h2"; attrs = {  }; children = list("Keep the interpretation open") },
                      {
                        tag = "p";
                        attrs = {  };
                        children = list(
                          "The Field proposes retaining agency and correction. That is a contestable commitment, not a deduction from the calculations. Flexibility has costs; stable roles can be welcome; disagreement does not automatically imply dismissal. People affected by household decisions, including dependants, may have interests this two-person model does not represent."
                        )
                      },
                      {
                        tag = "nav";
                        attrs = { "aria-label" = "Inspect or leave this example"; class = "q-actions" };
                        children = list(
                          {
                            tag = "a";
                            attrs = { href = "../"; class = "q-text-link" };
                            children = list("Return to the household example →")
                          },
                          {
                            tag = "a";
                            attrs = { href = "../../"; class = "q-text-link" };
                            children = list("Return to The Field →")
                          },
                          {
                            tag = "a";
                            attrs = { href = "../../../questions.html"; class = "q-text-link" };
                            children = list("Leave for Questions →")
                          }
                        )
                      }
                    )
                  },
                  {
                    tag = "section";
                    attrs = {
                      class = "q-section hh-section hh-related";
                      id = "hh-related";
                      "aria-labelledby" = "hh-related-heading"
                    };
                    children = list(
                      { tag = "p"; attrs = { class = "eyebrow" }; children = list("Related questions") },
                      {
                        tag = "h2";
                        attrs = { id = "hh-related-heading" };
                        children = list("A household is also a relationship.")
                      },
                      {
                        tag = "p";
                        attrs = {  };
                        children = list(
                          "The Field holds this experiment because choices change what can happen next. These questions place the model beside the rest of the corpus:"
                        )
                      },
                      {
                        tag = "ul";
                        attrs = { class = "hh-related-links" };
                        children = list(
                          {
                            tag = "li";
                            attrs = {  };
                            children = list(
                              { tag = "a"; attrs = { href = "../../../places/care.html" }; children = list("Care") },
                              {
                                tag = "p";
                                attrs = {  };
                                children = list("what remains owed when an arrangement becomes difficult?")
                              }
                            )
                          },
                          {
                            tag = "li";
                            attrs = {  };
                            children = list(
                              {
                                tag = "a";
                                attrs = { href = "../../../places/revision.html" };
                                children = list("Revision")
                              },
                              { tag = "p"; attrs = {  }; children = list("what can be reopened, and who can ask?") }
                            )
                          },
                          {
                            tag = "li";
                            attrs = {  };
                            children = list(
                              {
                                tag = "a";
                                attrs = { href = "../../../places/permission.html" };
                                children = list("Permission")
                              },
                              {
                                tag = "p";
                                attrs = {  };
                                children = list("who authorizes a choice on someone else’s behalf?")
                              }
                            )
                          },
                          {
                            tag = "li";
                            attrs = {  };
                            children = list(
                              {
                                tag = "a";
                                attrs = { href = "../../../relationship-manager/" };
                                children = list("Rupture and repair")
                              },
                              {
                                tag = "p";
                                attrs = {  };
                                children = list("how might a relationship find contact again?")
                              }
                            )
                          }
                        )
                      },
                      {
                        tag = "p";
                        attrs = { class = "hh-small" };
                        children = list(
                          "These relationships locate the example; they do not provide empirical validation for its authored rules."
                        )
                      }
                    )
                  }
                )
              }
            )
          },
          {
            tag = "footer";
            attrs = { class = "footer" };
            children = list(
              {
                tag = "div";
                attrs = {  };
                children = list(
                  { tag = "p"; attrs = { class = "signature" }; children = list("Aaron Alderman") },
                  {
                    tag = "p";
                    attrs = {  };
                    children = list("A few things I’ve built. A few things I’m still trying to understand.")
                  }
                )
              },
              {
                tag = "nav";
                attrs = { "aria-label" = "Elsewhere" };
                children = list(
                  {
                    tag = "a";
